{
  "id": "LUK.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 13",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ūlū mutagalūkile mukūyagala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo, bamò abo baalī henaho būng'wīla mihayo ya bana Galilaya balebe, abo Pilato walī wababūlaga ng'wikanza lya kūfunya shitambo shabo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbashokeja alīhaya, “Muliganika gīkī a bana Galilaya abo īkabilongela ī yenīyo, baalī na shibi kūtinda pye a bana Galilaya a bangī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla ītī gīko na hado yaya, alīyo ūlū mutagalūkile, na a bing'we pyī mukūyagala gīko! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo muliganika gīkī a banhū abo ikūmi na banaane abo bakagwīlwa numba mu Siloamu būūcha, baalī bakenaagūji no kūtinda pye a bikaji ba Yelusalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla ītī gīko na hado yaya, alīyo ūlū mutagalūkile na a bing'we pyī mukūyagala gīko!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūsumo lwa ntini gūtatwajaga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbinha lūsumo ūhaya gīkī, “Munhū nebe walī wahamba ntini mu ngūnda gokwe, alīyo būlī ikanza ūlū wiza ho kūlola matwajo walī atapandīkaga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ūng'wīla ū nīmi, ‘Ūlībona gīkī yashikaga myaka idatū ī haha nakūmanaga niza a ha ntini gwenūyū kūlola matwajo, alīyo ndūhū nūūlū kūpandīka; ī gete gūbbutage wa, nibūlī gwikale gūnikenaagūja ilaale lyane sagala dūhū!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū nīmi ūng'wīla, ‘Baba gūlekage nahene ū ng'waka gwenūyū dūhū nagūgeme kūgūbeeja beegeja, nagūtūūlīle na maboleela boleela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū gūtwaja īkūbeelela, alīyo ūlū ītī chene, nahene ūkūgūbbuta!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpījiwa kwa nkīma nemehazu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lūngī yalī sabato, ū Yesu walangaga ng'wisinagogi līmò lyaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīmo na nkīma walī wagung'humiwa moyo gwa būgokolo; walī atadūgije kūgūngūmūka kūshisha ikanza lya myaka ikūmi n'īnaane! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho wamona ūng'witana ūng'wīla gīkī, “Bebe mayū otaligūlagwa ū mu makoye gako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūntūūlīla makono, haho na haho ūgūngūmūka wandya kūnkumīlīja Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale w'isinagogi akapelana no aho wabona gīkī ū Yesu wampīja munhū ha sabato, ūbawīla a banhū gīkī, “Bing'we jilīho shikū itandatū ī ja kūtūmama milīmo, mulizage ng'wapījiwa ū mu jenījo, yaya a ha lūshikū lo sabato!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūnshokeja gīkī, “Bing'we bibeeleja, ī gīsī a ha sabato būlī ng'wene ū mu bing'we atataligūlīlaga ng'ombe nūūlū nzobe yakwe waja kwīng'wisha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Al'ū munhū ūyū oluhiwa na Shetani ikanza lya myaka ikūmi n'īnaane ī yose īyo, nīyo hangī nshīke o ng'wa Abulahamu gete, nibūlī atigeleelilwe ū ng'wene ū kwifuujiwa a ha sabato?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wīhaya ī yenīyo pye abo bang'wītīlaga wilu bakagooka kībi no! Pyī ī libita lya banhū bīkumīlīja ī yawiza īyo akabeeja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo shibīlī sha būtemi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūhaya gīkī, “Ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu būbizile gītī kī? Hīmba ūlū kūwikolanīja na kī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū boi būlī gītī kabīyū ka haladali, ako munhū akakasola ūūkakahamba mu ngūnda gokwe. Kahayūzwa kūkūla gūbiza ntī ntaale, kūshisha nose na noni ja kūlala jūpandīka wikalo ū mu matambī gago.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma hangī ūhaya, “Nawikolanīje na kī ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiyikolile na shibimbya, īsho nkīma akasola ūgulanya mu ngele idatū ja būsu, shūbūdudumya pyī ū bose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwingīlīla ha mita mpine",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho alīja Yelusalemu, waja akūlangaga ū mu mizengo nū mu magūngūli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla munhū nebe omūja gīkī, “Seeba angū mmho ī gete abo bakūpījiwa balī bagehu no?” Nang'hwe ūbawīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Igaganījagi ū kūbītīla a ha mita ū mpine, nguno balī bingī abo bakūgema ū kwingīla alīyo bakūlemeelwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managi gīkī, ū ng'wenekīlī kaya ūlū ūlinda wīmīīla kūgūlugala ū nyango, ning'we ng'ūsangwa mutaalī hanze, mukūhoodisha no, kūnū mukūhayaga; ‘Seeba tūlugūlīlage nise!’ Alīyo ū wei akūmushokeja amuwīle gīkī, ‘A bing'we natūmumanaga, pyī nū kūko mulīfuma!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning'we mukūhaya, ‘Angū twalyaga na kūng'wa hamò nang'ho; hama nīyo ū bebe walomeelaga nū mu mapanda gise!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akūmushokeja amuwīle gīkī, ‘Bing'we bīīti ba mihayo yabūbi, nalīmuwīla natūmanaga ūko mulīfuma, nīngīlagi a henaha!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūkūbiza ho kūlīla, na kūshelanya mino; ūlū ng'ūbabona ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu a ba Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo; hamò na a bahangi a bose, alīyo a bing'we ng'waponyiagwa hanze! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū bakūfuma kīya na ng'weli, bangī sukuma na dakama bize bigashe kūlya shilīwa ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike balīho aha abo balī kū numa, alīyo bakūbiza kū būtongi, na a babo balī kū būtongi, abo bakūbiza ba kū numa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgūlīlīīla nzengo gwa Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo biza Bafalisayo kūng'wīla gīkī, “Ni wīnga a henaha, nguno ū Helode alīkooba kūkūbūlaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Jagi mukīwīle ī nyamhawa yenīyo gīkī, ‘ī lelo nī ntondo nalīmalīja kūpeeja masamva na kūpīja banhū, ū lo kadatū lwaho nakūbiza namala maja.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike īnigeleelilwe nabize mu lūgendo ī lelo nī ntondo, nī ntondo būngī; nguno ītadūlīkanile ū ng'hangi achīle hanze ya Yelusalemu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, Yelusalemu, Yelusalemu mūlagibo bahangi; bebe ūyo ūkabapondaga mawe abo ūkatūmīlagwa. Nashishaga ng'hangala jinga nakūgemaga kūbakuminga kuminga a baana bako, gīt'ūmo ngoko īkakumingīlaga zwiyū jayo, yajibandīla mu manana gayo; alīyo mutatogilwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managi gīkī ng'walekelagwa ī numba ying'we. Nguno nalīmuwīla mutūnibona hangī kūshisha aho mukūhaya gīkī, ‘Alī na lubango ūyo aliza mu lina lya ng'wa Seeba!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
